The building needs 9 windows and 6 are already installed. So, the number of windows remaining to be installed is 9 - 6 = 3 windows.

It takes 6 hours to install each window.  Since there are 3 windows remaining, the total time required to install the rest is 3 windows * 6 hours/window = 18 hours.

