43 - 8 + 39

Wendy starts with 43 lives.  She loses 8 lives, so we subtract 8 from 43: 43 - 8 = 35. Then, she gains 39 lives, so we add 39 to 35: 35 + 39 = 74.  Therefore, Wendy would have 74 lives.

